== Icelandic ==
{{Is-Numeral(fjórir)|fjörutíu og }}
===Etymology===
From ''[[fjörutíu]]'' meaning "[[forty]]" + ''[[og]]'' "[[and]]" + ''[[fjórir]]'' "[[four]]". Meaning '''forty and four'''.
